stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IngestEvent: Kafka consumer receives ticket.created.v1
    IngestEvent --> CheckCache: Query SemanticCache (t:{tenantId}:cache:{hash})

    CheckCache --> CachedReturn: Cache Hit
    CheckCache --> TriageStep: Cache Miss

    TriageStep --> RetrieveStep: run_triage()<br/>- Detect intent category<br/>- Check financial keywords<br/>- Assess SLA urgency

    RetrieveStep --> ContextAssembly: run_retrieval()<br/>- Query Knowledge Service RAG<br/>- Extract chunks & citations

    ContextAssembly --> ResolutionStep: ContextManager<br/>- Layer System Policy<br/>- Layer Tenant Config<br/>- Layer Customer Profile<br/>- Layer Retrieved Chunks<br/>- Progressive Compression

    ResolutionStep --> CriticGuard: run_resolution()<br/>- Synthesize resolution plan<br/>- Check auto-refund thresholds

    CriticGuard --> RejectUnsafe: Fails Citation Grounding or Exceeds Boundaries
    CriticGuard --> ActionRoute: Passes Critic Verification

    state ActionRoute <<choice>>
    ActionRoute --> HumanApprovalPath: Plan == "HUMAN_APPROVAL_REQUIRED" (Financial / Irreversible)
    ActionRoute --> AutonomousResolvePath: Plan == "AUTONOMOUS_RESOLVE" (Safe Procedural)

    HumanApprovalPath --> RequestApproval: POST /api/v1/approvals (Workflow Service)
    RequestApproval --> PostPublicPending: Add Ticket Comment (PUBLIC: Awaiting Approval)
    PostPublicPending --> PostAuditNote: Add Internal Note (INTERNAL: Flagged for Manager)
    PostAuditNote --> TransitionPending: Transition Ticket Status: NEW -> OPEN -> PENDING
    TransitionPending --> TelemetryEmit

    AutonomousResolvePath --> PostPublicResolved: Add Ticket Comment (PUBLIC: Direct Solution)
    PostPublicResolved --> PostInternalResolved: Add Internal Note (INTERNAL: Solved autonomously)
    PostInternalResolved --> TransitionResolved: Transition Status: NEW -> OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED
    TransitionResolved --> TelemetryEmit

    RejectUnsafe --> ManualEscalate: Flag for manual agent intervention
    ManualEscalate --> TelemetryEmit

    TelemetryEmit --> UpdateCache: Cache query & resolution
    UpdateCache --> [*]: Emit usage.events.v1 to Kafka
